# AI Sprint Approach

## Order of work (mandatory)
1. **PRD** — feature PRD exists and is current (`docs/prds/`).
2. **Tests** — write failing unit tests from PRD test cases.
3. **Implement** — domain/service until tests pass.
4. **Wire** — API/UI last; keep controllers thin.
5. **Verify** — acceptance criteria checklist in PRD.

## One feature = one PRD
Do not mix Source Material and Sync Engine in one change set unless the sprint says so.

## Definition of done (feature)
- [ ] PRD acceptance criteria met
- [ ] Unit tests from PRD green
- [ ] Audit events for state-changing ops
- [ ] No secrets in logs
- [ ] Async for AI/parse/sync (never block REST for LLM)

## When unsure
Prefer lineage accuracy and instructor control over “smart” automation.
